1. d4 e6 2. Nf3 f5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 Be7 5. Bxf6 Bxf6 6. e4 fxe4 7. Nxe4 b6
8. Ne5 O-O {I castle kingside to keep my king safe.} 9. Bd3 Bb7
10. Qh5 {My queen joins the attack, right next to Black's king.} Qe7
11. Qxh7+ {Queen sacrifice! The king must take, and then it gets dragged out.}
Kxh7 {I have no choice: I must take the queen.}
12. Nxf6+ {Double check! The king has to move.} Kh6 13. Neg4+ Kg5
14. h4+ Kf4 15. g3+ Kf3 16. Be2+ Kg2 17. Rh2+ Kg1
